    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI OS — Memory Service\n**Reusable long-term memory (Postgres ai_os_memory).**\n\nInput: { operation, category, title, content, tags, source, importance, query, limit }\n- operation: `store` | `recall` | `search`\n- store: inserts a row (embedding_placeholder left NULL — future embedding hook)\n- recall: recent rows, optional category filter\n- search: keyword/tag ILIKE match (future: swap for pgvector nearest-neighbour)\n\nParameterized queries ($1,$2…) prevent SQL injection.",
